Diagnostic: env-gated stylesheet-invalidation logging (WEBKIT_STYLE_LOG=1).

Device gdb sampling of a franceinfo load shows ~44% of main-thread time in
CSS style resolution (TreeResolver/applyMatchedProperties/styleForPseudoElement).
Hypothesis: the site's ~42 stylesheets complete loading out of DOM order, and
each out-of-order completion inserts a sheet before an already-active one, which
analyzeStyleSheetChange classifies as Reset/Reconstruct -> full resolver rebuild
+ (often) invalidateAllStyle full-document restyle, repeated many times per load.

This counts and classifies the events to confirm the lever before optimizing.
With WEBKIT_STYLE_LOG=1 (off by default, zero overhead when unset) the WebProcess
logs on stderr, per Scope::updateActiveStyleSheets:
  [stylelog] updateActiveStyleSheets doc=.. updateType=.. resolver=Reconstruct|Reset|Additive
             oldSheets=.. newSheets=.. added=.. body=.. missingStyle=..
  [stylelog]   -> invalidateAllStyle (reconstruct=.. invalidateAll=..)   | -> targeted invalidate added=..
Aggregate the resolver= and invalidateAllStyle counts across one load to see how
many full rebuilds/restyles the sheet-arrival cadence actually causes.

--- a/Source/WebCore/style/StyleScope.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/style/StyleScope.cpp
@@ -67,6 +67,8 @@
 #include "UserContentController.h"
 #include "UserContentURLPattern.h"
 #include "UserStyleSheet.h"
+#include <cstdio>
+#include <cstdlib>
 #include <wtf/SetForScope.h>
 #include <wtf/TZoneMallocInlines.h>
 
@@ -78,6 +80,30 @@
 
 WTF_MAKE_TZONE_ALLOCATED_IMPL(Scope);
 
+// Diagnostic (WEBKIT_STYLE_LOG=1, off by default, zero overhead when unset): count and
+// classify stylesheet-driven style invalidations during load. A heavy page (franceinfo:
+// ~42 sheets) completing sheets out of DOM order forces repeated resolver rebuilds and
+// full-document restyles — device sampling shows ~44% of load main-thread time in style
+// resolution. Emits [stylelog] lines on WebProcess stderr.
+static bool styleLogEnabled()
+{
+    static bool enabled = [] {
+        const char* v = getenv("WEBKIT_STYLE_LOG");
+        return v && *v && *v != '0';
+    }();
+    return enabled;
+}
+
+static const char* resolverUpdateTypeName(ResolverUpdateType t)
+{
+    switch (t) {
+    case ResolverUpdateType::Reconstruct: return "Reconstruct";
+    case ResolverUpdateType::Reset: return "Reset";
+    case ResolverUpdateType::Additive: return "Additive";
+    }
+    return "?";
+}
+
 Scope::Scope(Document& document)
     : m_document(document)
     , m_pendingUpdateTimer(*this, &Scope::pendingUpdateTimerFired)
